BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (cents per authorization at zero basis points, customized lifetime residuals you set merchant by merchant, a $20,000 fast) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (start bonus, up to $10,000 in upfront bonuses per merchant, and free PCI-compliant equipment that arrives pre-loaded) Tj ET
