BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.10 Tm (the gateway and the merchant account, one decision from them can shut down everything at once, and jumping 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.88 Tm (times your volume overnight is a great way to get noticed [-G2UpQAf8L0 @ 00:06:03]. A high-risk account is not a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 161.65 Tm (free pass either; Funnelish warns you can still lose it if chargebacks climb too high. The thresholds are lower than most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 146.43 Tm (operators assume. Scott E. Adams says a monitoring-program notice can trigger at over 100 chargebacks combined) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.20 Tm (with a ratio generally over 0.9 percent, and that merchants with no real relationship with their bank often have no idea) Tj ET
