BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (merchants miss: once a bank logs a fraud report, it counts toward Visa's ratio even if you refund the order later, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (fraud has to be stopped before you ship [NdTgGwtE_N4 @ 00:02:37]. Adams explains why that bites low-ticket sellers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (hardest: issuers often flag a cheap transaction as fraud without bothering to charge it back, and that flag still goes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (against you in Visa's fraud monitoring, so watching chargebacks alone leaves you blind and the TC40 file becomes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (critical [gJ_2exzq6FA @ 00:01:17]. RDR carries its own reporting trap. The refund is pulled by the acquirer and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (marked with what Adams believes is an M flag, but processors, ISOs and gateways further down the chain often never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (get that change, see a chargeback, and treat it as one, so you have to track it really carefully; RDR also does nothing to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (keep you out of the fraud program [5mi35dvcRrA @ 00:04:08]. Alerts, by contrast, more often clear both the fraud flag) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (and the chargeback, and Adams reports good luck getting clients out of monitoring programs with alerts and RDR in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (combination [5mi35dvcRrA @ 00:05:19].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (The last set of traps is operational and shows up directly in the margin. Chargeback.io warns that without a gateway) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (integration, Ethoca and CDRN alerts cannot be matched to the transaction, so you manually locate and refund every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (single alert, while only RDR refunds automatically without integration [sH9CslJpDeA @ 00:00:50]. Rayess says that at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (any real volume the 24 to 72-hour window is too tight for manual review, which is the whole case for RDR's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (automation [gH8-LQ4srZY @ 00:01:53]. Pablo Torres describes the small-team version of the failure: a one or two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (person dropshipping operation marking goods up 200 to 300 percent cannot keep up with customer inquiries, things fall) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (off the side, and chargebacks follow; silence the alerts on top of that and you cannot see the disease [fO958wEcK8A @) Tj ET
